# PRIORIZASUS — Code Owners
#
# These rules require review from the specified owners before merging.
# Configure branch protection in GitHub UI: Settings → Branches → Add Rule.
#
# Pattern                    Owners (GitHub usernames — replace with actual team)
# ───────                    ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

# All Java source code requires review
*.java                       @PRIORIZASUS/developers

# Spec layer — intent & requirements
.specs/**                    @PRIORIZASUS/architects

# Architecture decisions
docs/adr/**                  @PRIORIZASUS/architects

# Traceability matrix — formal approval evidence
docs/TRACEABILITY.md         @PRIORIZASUS/architects

# CI/CD pipelines — infrastructure changes
.github/workflows/**         @PRIORIZASUS/devops

# Canonical terminology — domain language
CONTEXT.md                   @PRIORIZASUS/architects

# AI instruction rules — agent behavior
.github/copilot-instructions.md  @PRIORIZASUS/architects
